{"title":{"rendered":"Prayer Times API"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>[et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.7.7&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;0px|||||&#8221;][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.7.7&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; width=&#8221;100%&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.7.7&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221;][et_pb_code _builder_version=&#8221;4.7.7&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221;]<\/p>\n<div class=\"masjidal-kb-article\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee>Use a server key to pull your masjid\u2019s prayer timings into your own backend code. A server key is a secret credential, so it belongs on your server and nowhere else. It unlocks one endpoint, the prayer timings for your masjid. Requests to any other endpoint are rejected.<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<div class=\"guide-note\" style=\"background:#eef4fc;border-left:4px solid #0047ab;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:20px 24px;margin:28px 0;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><strong style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;\">Building a website instead?<\/strong><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">Use the <a href=\"https:\/\/help.masjidal.com\/knowledge-base\/widget\/\" style=\"color:#0047ab;text-decoration:underline;\">website widgets<\/a> with a frontend key beginning with <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">msj_pk_<\/code>. Frontend keys are safe in page code because they only work from the domains you allow. A server key in a web page can be read and misused by anyone.<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/div>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:23px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:36px 0 16px;padding:0;\">1. Generate your server key<\/h2>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<ol style=\"padding-left:1.5em;margin:0 0 20px;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Sign in to your <a href=\"https:\/\/portal.masjidal.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#0047ab;text-decoration:underline;\">Masjidal portal<\/a> and select the correct masjid.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">In the left menu, open <strong>Integrations \u2192 API Keys<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">On the <strong>Server Key<\/strong> card, click <strong>Generate Server Key<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Copy the key and store it somewhere safe straight away. It begins with <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">msj_sk_<\/code> and is shown <strong>only once<\/strong>. After you close that window, it cannot be displayed again.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/ol>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee>Only masjid admins can generate, rotate, or disable a server key. If you lose the key, open the <strong>\u22ee<\/strong> menu on the Server Key card and choose <strong>Rotate key<\/strong> to get a new one.<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:23px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:36px 0 16px;padding:0;\">2. Store the key on your server<\/h2>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee>Save the key in an environment variable called <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">MASJIDAL_SERVER_KEY<\/code>, or in your hosting platform\u2019s secrets manager. The examples below read it from there, which keeps it out of your source code and out of version control.<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:23px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:36px 0 16px;padding:0;\">3. Set up the request<\/h2>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee>A server key works with the Timings endpoint:<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<pre style=\"background:#f3f6fb;border:1px solid #d6e1f0;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin:24px 0;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:none;padding:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\">GET https:\/\/api.masjidal.com\/timings?start_date={start}&end_date={end}<\/code><\/pre>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:28px 0 12px;padding:0;\">Query parameters<\/h3>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:0 0 20px;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #d6e1f0;margin:0;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<thead><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<tr><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;background:#f3f6fb;color:#003781;font-weight:600;padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1f0;\">Parameter<\/th>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;background:#f3f6fb;color:#003781;font-weight:600;padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1f0;\">Description<\/th>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/tr>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/thead>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<tbody><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<tr><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e8e8ed;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">start_date<\/code> <span style=\"color:#c62828;font-size:0.85em;\">required<\/span><\/td>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e8e8ed;vertical-align:top;\">First day of the period you want timings for, as <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">YYYY-MM-DD<\/code>.<\/td>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/tr>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<tr><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e8e8ed;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">end_date<\/code> <span style=\"color:#c62828;font-size:0.85em;\">required<\/span><\/td>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e8e8ed;vertical-align:top;\">Last day of the period, as <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">YYYY-MM-DD<\/code>. Must be on or after <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">start_date<\/code>.<\/td>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/tr>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/tbody>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/table>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/div>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee>Request the smallest range you need, ideally a single day:<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<pre><code>?start_date=2026-11-08&end_date=2026-11-08<\/code><\/pre>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  If your display shows tomorrow&#8217;s Fajr after Isha, request today and tomorrow.<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  Call once per day, cache the result, and reuse it until the date changes.<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  Don&#8217;t request timings on every page load, screen refresh, or app open.<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<div style=\"border-left: 4px solid #d93025; background: #fdecea; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  <pee style=\"margin: 0;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    <strong>Important: excessive calls are blocked.<\/strong><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    Requests that repeat the same dates, ask for more days than needed, or arrive too often<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    are blocked automatically.<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  <\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/div>\n<h3 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:28px 0 12px;padding:0;\">Required headers<\/h3>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:0 0 20px;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #d6e1f0;margin:0;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<thead><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<tr><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;background:#f3f6fb;color:#003781;font-weight:600;padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1f0;\">Header<\/th>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;background:#f3f6fb;color:#003781;font-weight:600;padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1f0;\">Value<\/th>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/tr>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/thead>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<tbody><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<tr><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e8e8ed;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">Accept<\/code><\/td>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e8e8ed;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">application\/vnd.masjidal.com.v1+json<\/code><!\u2013- [et_pb_br_holder] -\u2013>Selects version 1 of the API. Send it on every request.<\/td>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/tr>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<tr><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e8e8ed;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">x-api-key<\/code><\/td>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e8e8ed;vertical-align:top;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">msj_sk_\u2026<\/code><!\u2013- [et_pb_br_holder] -\u2013>Your server key, exactly as copied, with no quotes and no <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">Bearer<\/code> prefix.<\/td>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/tr>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/tbody>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/table>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/div>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:23px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:36px 0 16px;padding:0;\">4. Make a request<\/h2>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee>Each example requests timings for August 2026 and reads the key from the <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">MASJIDAL_SERVER_KEY<\/code> environment variable. Change the dates to the range you need.<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:28px 0 12px;padding:0;\">cURL<\/h3>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<pre style=\"background:#f3f6fb;border:1px solid #d6e1f0;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin:24px 0;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:none;padding:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\">curl -G \"https:\/\/api.masjidal.com\/timings\" \\<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  --data-urlencode \"start_date=2026-08-01\" \\<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  --data-urlencode \"end_date=2026-08-31\" \\<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  -H \"Accept: application\/vnd.masjidal.com.v1+json\" \\<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  -H \"x-api-key: $MASJIDAL_SERVER_KEY\"<\/code><\/pre>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:28px 0 12px;padding:0;\">Node.js<\/h3>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<pre style=\"background:#f3f6fb;border:1px solid #d6e1f0;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin:24px 0;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:none;padding:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\">const params = new URLSearchParams({<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  start_date: '2026-08-01',<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  end_date: '2026-08-31',<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->});<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->const response = await fetch(`https:\/\/api.masjidal.com\/timings?${params}`, {<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  headers: {<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    'Accept': 'application\/vnd.masjidal.com.v1+json',<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    'x-api-key': process.env.MASJIDAL_SERVER_KEY,<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  },<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->});<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->if (!response.ok) {<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->  throw new Error(`Masjidal timings request failed: ${response.status}`);<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->}<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->const timings = await response.json();<\/code><\/pre>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:28px 0 12px;padding:0;\">PHP<\/h3>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<pre style=\"background:#f3f6fb;border:1px solid #d6e1f0;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin:24px 0;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:none;padding:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\">$url = 'https:\/\/api.masjidal.com\/timings?' . http_build_query([<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    'start_date' => '2026-08-01',<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    'end_date'   => '2026-08-31',<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->]);<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->$ch = curl_init($url);<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->curl_setopt_array($ch, [<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER => true,<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER => [<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->        'Accept: application\/vnd.masjidal.com.v1+json',<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->        'x-api-key: ' . getenv('MASJIDAL_SERVER_KEY'),<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    ],<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->]);<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->$timings = json_decode(curl_exec($ch), true);<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->curl_close($ch);<\/code><\/pre>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:28px 0 12px;padding:0;\">Python<\/h3>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<pre style=\"background:#f3f6fb;border:1px solid #d6e1f0;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin:24px 0;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"color:#003781;background:none;padding:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\">import os<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->import requests<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->response = requests.get(<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    \"https:\/\/api.masjidal.com\/timings\",<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    params={\"start_date\": \"2026-08-01\", \"end_date\": \"2026-08-31\"},<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    headers={<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->        \"Accept\": \"application\/vnd.masjidal.com.v1+json\",<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->        \"x-api-key\": os.environ[\"MASJIDAL_SERVER_KEY\"],<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    },<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->    timeout=10,<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->)<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->response.raise_for_status()<!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] -->timings = response.json()<\/code><\/pre>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee>A successful request returns JSON with the prayer timings for each day in the range you asked for.<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:23px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:36px 0 16px;padding:0;\">Keeping your key safe<\/h2>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<div class=\"guide-note guide-warning\" style=\"background:#fdf0ef;border-left:4px solid #c62828;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;padding:20px 24px;margin:28px 0;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><strong style=\"display:block;font-weight:600;\">Treat your server key like a password<\/strong><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">Anyone who has it can pull your masjid\u2019s data. It is never shown again after you generate it, and Masjidal support cannot recover it for you.<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/div>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee><strong>Do:<\/strong><\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<ul style=\"padding-left:1.5em;margin:0 0 20px;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Keep it in an environment variable or your hosting platform\u2019s secrets manager.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Call the API from your own backend, then pass the results to your pages.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/ul>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee><strong>Don\u2019t:<\/strong><\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<ul style=\"padding-left:1.5em;margin:0 0 20px;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Put it in website HTML or JavaScript, a mobile app, or anything a visitor can view.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Commit it to a Git repository, paste it into a support ticket, or send it over chat or email.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">Share one key between organizations. Each masjid uses its own.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/ul>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:19px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:28px 0 12px;padding:0;\">If a key is exposed<\/h3>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee>Open <strong>Integrations \u2192 API Keys<\/strong> and use the <strong>\u22ee<\/strong> menu on the Server Key card:<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<ul style=\"padding-left:1.5em;margin:0 0 20px;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>Rotate key:<\/strong> issues a replacement and stops the old key immediately. Have the new key ready to paste into your server config, because anything still using the old one stops working the moment you rotate.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>Disable key:<\/strong> switches the key off for good with no replacement. Use this when you are retiring an integration. It cannot be undone; you would need to generate a fresh key to start again.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/ul>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#0047ab;font-size:23px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:36px 0 16px;padding:0;\">If a request fails<\/h2>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<ul style=\"padding-left:1.5em;margin:0 0 20px;\"><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>Rejected as unauthorized:<\/strong> check that the <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">x-api-key<\/code> header is present and spelled correctly, and that the value has no stray quotes or spaces. Confirm the key starts with <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">msj_sk_<\/code> and hasn\u2019t been rotated or disabled in the portal.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>The response isn\u2019t in the format you expected:<\/strong> the <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">Accept<\/code> header must be exactly <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">application\/vnd.masjidal.com.v1+json<\/code>. Some HTTP clients replace it with a default unless you set it explicitly.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>Fewer days than you asked for, or none:<\/strong> check that both dates are <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">YYYY-MM-DD<\/code> and that <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">end_date<\/code> is not earlier than <code style=\"color:#003781;background:#eef4fc;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:0.9em;\">start_date<\/code>.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>It worked yesterday and fails today:<\/strong> someone most likely rotated or disabled the key in the portal. Rotating takes effect immediately, so put the current key, or a newly generated one, into your server config.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/p>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"><strong>It works locally but fails once deployed:<\/strong> the environment variable holding the key probably isn\u2019t set on the server. Check your hosting platform\u2019s environment settings.<\/li>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/ul>\n<p><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><pee>Need help? Email <a href=\"mailto:masjidsupport@masjidal.com\" style=\"color:#0047ab;text-decoration:underline;\">masjidsupport@masjidal.com<\/a>. Never include your server key in the message.<\/pee><!-- [et_pb_line_break_holder] --><\/div>\n<p>[\/et_pb_code][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section]<\/p>\n","protected":false}}